{"id":"n69478-4-6","stage":1,"title":"믿다 · 信","scene":"文化与信仰","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69478-4-6-1","ko":"아이들이 산타클로스한테서 선물을 받았다니 무슨 말이야?","zh":"孩子们说收到了圣诞老人的礼物，这到底是什么意思？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이들이","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이들이","audio":"/audio/ac32747784d62b1df40f.mp3"}},{"text":"산타클로스한테서","meaning":"圣诞老人","explanation":"산타클로스：圣诞老人；한테서：口语中表示“从某人那里”。","readings":[{"term":"산타클로스한테서","audio":"/audio/7c4b307ad6ae2637b942.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산타클로스한테서","audio":"/audio/7c4b307ad6ae2637b942.mp3"}},{"text":"선물을","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선물을","audio":"/audio/9f3490a05172f0786ee4.mp3"}},{"text":"받았다니","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받았다니","audio":"/audio/791da6ab9ece46cbf93b.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야?","meaning":"意思","explanation":"말：意思；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"7","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"意思","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示再次强调或确认。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/a7d27c94e6bd8806ed5c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69478-4-6-2","ko":"빨간 옷을 입은 사람을 산타클로스라고 믿어서 그래요.","zh":"因为他们以为穿红衣服的人就是圣诞老人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빨간","meaning":"红","explanation":"빨갛다：红；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"빨갛다","audio":"/audio/6edc039e433d1613937c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71070","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨갛다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨간","audio":"/audio/0ae988272a93c5b5b782.mp3"}},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷을","audio":"/audio/76fa7acf1b0008045d0c.mp3"}},{"text":"입은","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입은","audio":"/audio/498d566b215f0ddb04af.mp3"}},{"text":"사람을","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람을","audio":"/audio/e4ea86ef494eafea0006.mp3"}},{"text":"산타클로스라고","meaning":"圣诞老人","explanation":"산타클로스：圣诞老人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"산타클로스라고","audio":"/audio/c5baada8cc63645bed0a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산타클로스라고","audio":"/audio/c5baada8cc63645bed0a.mp3"}},{"text":"믿어서","meaning":"信，坚信，当作","explanation":"믿다：信，坚信，当作；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"믿다","audio":"/audio/03fdf42bef953df48966.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69478","senseId":"4","lemma":"믿다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"믿어서","audio":"/audio/36b48dcb6002af6f9746.mp3"}},{"text":"그래요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래요","audio":"/audio/b6894238d8eae709ebfd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6edc039e433d1613","term":"빨갛다","zh":"红","audio":"/audio/6edc039e433d1613937c.mp3","entryId":"71070","definition":"如同鲜血或熟透的辣椒一样鲜明而浓艳地发红。","pronunciation":["빨ː가타"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"03fdf42bef953df4","term":"믿다","zh":"信，坚信，当作","audio":"/audio/03fdf42bef953df48966.mp3","entryId":"69478","definition":"毫不怀疑地认为某个对象为另一种存在。","pronunciation":["믿따"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/73100a113b9dc5ad9bc4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.72,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69478","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":48,"sequenceScore":2.1205,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为他们以为穿红衣服的人就是圣诞老人。","爸爸为什么气得那么厉害啊？","孩子们说收到了圣诞老人的礼物，这到底是什么意思？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为他们以为穿红衣服的人就是圣诞老人。","孩子们说收到了圣诞老人的礼物，这到底是什么意思？","爸爸为什么气得那么厉害啊？"],"answer":0}]}
